abstract: >
  BeliefBench is a regenerable evaluation artifact for misinformation-aware
  social agents with inspectable needs, trust, and source-confidence beliefs,
  schema-versioned JSONL traces, diagnostic scenarios, and mechanism/policy metrics.
keywords:
  - social agents
  - belief provenance
  - misinformation
  - multi-agent systems
  - reproducible benchmarks
